<%# The editor for an existing note, rendered into the board's frame — what a
    card opens (PRD §8.2). The same URL asked for without that frame renders
    the full pane instead (`pane.html.erb`, §7.7): one note, one address, and
    the surface follows where the click came from. %>
<%= turbo_frame_tag "editor" do %>
  <%= render "notes/editor", note: @note, folders: @folders %>
<% end %>
